<title>BELGIUM: TENNIS-EUROPEAN COMMUNITY CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-EUROPEAN COMMUNITY CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ANTWERP, Belgium 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final results at</p>
<p>the $1 million European Community tennis championship on Friday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Petr Korda (Czech Republic) beat Dick Norman (Belgium) 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Marc Goellner (Germany) beat Martin Damm (Czech Republic) 3-1</p>
<p>retired</p>
<p>6-Tim Henman (Britain) beat Francisco Clavet (Spain) 7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>Marc Rosset (Switzerland) beat Filip Dewulf (Belgium) 4-6 6-1 6-4</p>
</text>
